        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Create a new NavigableString.

When unpickling a NavigableString, this method is called with
the string in DEFAULT_OUTPUT_ENCODING. That encoding needs to be
passed in to the superclass&apos;s __new__ or the superclass won&apos;t know
how to handle non-ASCII characters.
</verbatim> </para>
