      </memberdef>
    </sectiondef>
    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>A Python string that is part of a parse tree.

When Beautiful Soup parses the markup ``&lt;b&gt;penguin&lt;/b&gt;``, it will
create a `NavigableString` for the string &quot;penguin&quot;.
</verbatim> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
